        "Aashcharyakarudu – Advitheeyudu",
        "Paskaa balipashuthaanai – Gorrepillaga vachchenu",
        "Chedarina mandanu samakoorcha kaaparigaa vachchenu",
        "Manchikaapari – Goppakaapari",
        "Aathmalakaapari – Pradhaanakaapari",
        "Dhanavanthulugaa cheyutaku – Dheenudugaa vachchenu",
